@base = http://localhost:5106
@token = replace-with-an-access-token
@id = replace-with-a-public-accommodation-guid

### Public liveness check
GET {{base}}/health

### Create a private accommodation
POST {{base}}/api/v1/accommodations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Example lodging",
  "address": "1 Main Street",
  "lat": 45.5019,
  "lon": -73.5674
}

### Search visible accommodations
GET {{base}}/api/v1/accommodations?name=lodging
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read a visible accommodation
GET {{base}}/api/v1/accommodations/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
